<title>USA: Milton Federal to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Milton Federal to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>WEST MILTON, Ohio 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Milton Federal Financial Corp said on Tuesday it was going to buy back up to five percent of its common stock during the next six months.</p>
<p>The company, a holding company for Milton Federal Savings Bank, said it fill fund the repurchase with money earned from the sale of securities from an investment portfolio.  </p>
<p>A company official said it was the third time that Milton Federal was buying back stock.</p>
<p>It began buying up its stock for the second time in October 1996, he said, adding that it had so far bought back 10 percent of its stock.</p>
<p>Milton Federal shares were down 1/8 on Tuesday, at 13-1/2.</p>
</text>
